IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fata-residential`

-- Foreign Acquisitions and Takeovers Act 1975 (Cth), residential land -- worked cases, from the seat of the home buyer.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case, a FIRB guidance note or a Treasury decision.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table (scratchpad gen_foreign-acquisitions-and-takeovers-act-1975_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text of the Act
-- and of the Foreign Acquisitions and Takeovers Regulation 2015.

