#ASSERT `Must I notify the Treasurer before I buy` `Priya, a permanent resident who arrived 120 days ago` `d037: the East Perth apartment, joint tenants with Daniel` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I notify the Treasurer before I buy` `Mei, on a four-year temporary visa, 300 days here` `d037: the East Perth apartment, joint tenants with Daniel` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `Must I notify the Treasurer before I buy` `Mei, on a four-year temporary visa, 300 days here` `d037 variant: the same apartment as tenants in common with Daniel` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Must I notify the Treasurer before I buy` `Mei, on a four-year temporary visa, 300 days here` `d037 variant: the same apartment bought alone` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `Must I notify the Treasurer before I buy` `Hans, overseas on a short visitor visa` `a new apartment from the developer, never occupied, bought alone` EQUALS TRUE
